<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Votorantim raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Votorantim raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it has upgraded its recommendation for Brazilian pulp and paper firm Votorantim Celulose e Papel S.A. to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;This is kind of a best-kept secret in Brazil,&quot; said bank analyst Prabhas (PR) Panigrahi.</p>
<p>-- He said that despite strong fundamentals, the firm has severely underperformed the market.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company's already strong operating cash flow should become only stronger as aggressive capacity expansion into value-added products materializes over the next two years,&quot; Panigrahi said in a report.</p>
</text>
